Package: netbox-dns-zone-publisher
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, bind9-utils, openssh-client,
 ca-certificates, adduser
Description: publish NetBox DNS snapshots to local and remote DNS servers
 Collect DNS records from NetBox DNS, retain normalized snapshots, optionally
 sign zones with DNSSEC, and deploy verified zone files locally or over SSH.
 Includes a systemd timer for periodic collection and publication.
